      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "LYS.",
      "text": "I see a man approaching, a man. Look. Does any one of you recognise the man who is approaching?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 2,
      "bbox": [
        140,
        115,
        158,
        298
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "MYRRHINE",
      "text": "My god!",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 3,
      "bbox": [
        162,
        114,
        195,
        874
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "KLE.",
      "text": "It’s clear, Lysistrata, that Myrrhine has recognised him. For after seeing him and recognising him she cried ‘My god!’",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 4,
      "bbox": [
        199,
        114,
        231,
        863
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "LYS.",
      "text": "Speak, Myrrhine. Does Kleonike speak the truth? Have you recognised the man? For to me as well you seem to recognise the man.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 5,
      "bbox": [
        235,
        114,
        252,
        785
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "MYR.",
      "text": "By Zeus, I do recognise him. For he is Kinesias, whose wife I am.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 6,
      "bbox": [
        257,
        114,
        274,
        895
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "LYS.",
      "text": "It’s your job now to trick and love and not to love this man who you live with.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 7,
      "bbox": [
        278,
        114,
        294,
        393
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "MYR.",
      "text": "I shall do these things.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 8,
      "bbox": [
        297,
        114,
        331,
        886
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "LYS.",
      "text": "Look, I’ll join you in tricking him by waiting here after sending away the old women whose job it is to guard the Acropolis.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
