        871
      ],
      "margin_number": 2,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "σπασμός GE gives ‘discomfort’. Presumably Kinesias’ problem was a massive erection. Comic actors wore a padded costume with a large phallus attached, so Kinesias’ condition would be clear for all to see.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 12,
      "bbox": [
        447,
        168,
        461,
        781
      ],
      "margin_number": 7,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἀνὴρ δῆτα ‘Indeed I am a man.’ Kinesias confirms the obvious.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 13,
      "bbox": [
        465,
        157,
        501,
        915
      ],
      "margin_number": 12,
      "speaker": "12",
      "text": "πρὸς ἑαυτὸν λέγων ‘speaking to himself’. Remember the reflexive ἑαυτόν or αὐτόν.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 14,
      "bbox": [
        504,
        157,
        554,
        882
      ],
      "margin_number": 13,
      "speaker": "13–14",
      "text": "οἱ θεοί, οἷς εὔχομαι ... ‘the gods to whom I pray ...’\nδώσουσι ‘will grant’. δίδωμι now makes many appearances. Learn GE pp.\n134–136, #131.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 15,
      "bbox": [
        563,
        158,
        577,
        597
      ],
      "margin_number": 18,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἐκ-κάλεσον ‘call out’, aorist imperative from ἐκ-καλέω.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
